格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":":zap:The ultimate image uploading engine. Both CLI & API supports.","id":"gh:149085734","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"PicGo-Core","slug":"PicGo/PicGo-Core","topics":["dsh-plugin","picgo","picture-upload","upload-pictures"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":":zap:The ultimate image uploading engine. Both CLI & API supports."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Special thanks to"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Modelflare\nModelflare: Full strength, stable, nothing watered down. Global SOTA models at a lower co"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"elflare\nModelflare: Full strength, stable, nothing watered down. Global SOTA models at a lower cost."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Castaly\nCastaly: Full strength, no upscaling. 40+ image and video models, including NSFW."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"NocoBase\nAI + No-Code Build reliable business systems"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Neon\nFast Postgres Databases for Teams and Agents"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"# PicGo-Core"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A tool for image uploading. Both CLI & api supports. It also supports plugin system, please check Aw"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"esome-PicGo to find powerful plugins."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"More details please see the Homepage of PicGo."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Typora supports PicGo-Core natively**."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"PicGo requires Node.js >= 20.19.0 or >= 22.12.0. For older PicGo versions (<= v1.5.x), Node.js >= 16"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" is sufficient. Cause we need the stability of ES Module support."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Global install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Local install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Use in CLI"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> PicGo uses `SM.MS(S.EE)` as the default upload image host."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Show help:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"#### Upload a picture from path"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"#### Upload with a saved configuration"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Use `--configName` to choose a saved configuration for one upload. Add `--uploader` when the same na"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"me exists in multiple uploader types. You can also use `--configId`; a unique ID match takes precede"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"nce over the name, and an unresolved ID falls back to the name when provided."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"These options use the same lookup rules as HTTP and SDK uploads and do not change saved defaults. Wi"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"thout these options, `picgo upload` retains its existing default behavior. Existing local input file"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"s are retained after upload; only temporary multipart files and clipboard images created by PicGo ar"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"e cleaned up. Clipboard filenames keep the existing `YYYYMMDDHHmmssSSS.png` format."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"#### Upload a picture from clipboard"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> picture from clipboard will be converted to `png`"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Thanks to vs-picgo && Spades-S for providing the method to upload picture from clipboard."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"#### Run as a server"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"##### Select a configuration for one upload"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Add `uploader`, `configName`, or `configId` to `POST /upload` to choose an existing saved configurat"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ion for that request. Configuration names are recommended for readability. Use URL encoding for name"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"s containing spaces, Chinese characters, or other special characters:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The same query parameters work with an empty body for clipboard uploads, JSON without `list` or with"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" an empty `list`, and multipart uploads using the `files` field. If server authentication is enabled"},{"id":"p37s3","text":", include your existing `Authorization: Bearer <secret>` header."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| Upload options | Behavior |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| No upload options | Existing default upload behavior. |\n| `uploader=github` | Use GitHub's current"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ly selected configuration (`defaultId`, falling back to its first configuration). |\n| `uploader=gith"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ub&configName=Work` | Find `Work` within GitHub, ignoring case and surrounding whitespace. |\n| `conf"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"igName=Work` | Search registered uploader types; exactly one configuration must match. |\n| `configId"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"=<id>` | Search by exact ID, optionally restricted by `uploader`. IDs remain stable when configurati"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"ons are renamed. |\n| Both `configId` and `configName` | Use a unique ID match first; if it cannot be"},{"id":"p39s7","text":" uniquely resolved, try the name. |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Unknown uploaders, missing or ambiguous configurations, and blank or repeated upload parameters retu"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"rn HTTP `400` with `{ success: false, result: [], items: [], code, message }`. Messages explain the "},{"id":"p40s3","text":"lookup failure or ambiguity; specify `uploader` to disambiguate names shared across types. Invalid u"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"pload options never fall back to the global default uploader. Existing authentication failures remai"},{"id":"p40s5","text":" never fall back to the global default uploader. Existing authentication failures remain HTTP `401`."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"#### Login to PicGo Cloud"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"#### Logout from PicGo Cloud"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"#### Check PicGo Cloud login status"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Use `picgo cloud auth status` to inspect the current PicGo Cloud login state without triggering an i"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"nteractive login. The check is non-blocking: when there is no local token it returns immediately wit"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"hout any network request."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"The command sets a process exit code so it can be used in scripts:"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"| Status        | Meaning                                          | Exit code |"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"| `logged_in`   | Token is valid                                   | `0`       |\n| `logged_out`  | N"},{"id":"p51s2","text":"o local token                                   | `1`       |\n| `invalid`     | Token exists but is "},{"id":"p51s3","text":"rejected by the server (401) | `2`       |\n| `error`       | Probe failed (network / server error)  "},{"id":"p51s4","text":"          | `3`       |"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"The `--format json` output is a single line, e.g.:"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"#### Inspect current module config"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"Use `picgo get` to read the currently selected picgo modules. Each subcommand supports `--format pre"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"tty|json` (defaults to `pretty`)."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"In `json` mode each command prints a single parseable line, e.g.:"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"#### Manage uploader configs"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"Since v1.8.0, PicGo-Core supports multiple configurations per uploader. Just like the configuration "},{"id":"p60s2","text":"of the Electron version of PicGo."},{"id":"p61s1","text":"You can use `picgo set uploader <type> [configName]` to configure different uploader configurations."},{"id":"p62s1","text":"And you can use `picgo use uploader <type> [configName]` to switch between different uploader config"},{"id":"p62s2","text":"an use `picgo use uploader <type> [configName]` to switch between different uploader configurations."},{"id":"p63s1","text":"For example:"},{"id":"p64s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p65s1","text":"For more details, you can use `picgo uploader -h` to check the help of uploader management:"},{"id":"p66s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p67s1","text":"#### Init a picgo plugin template"},{"id":"p68s1","text":"Note: the plugin's template initializer has moved to the standalone picgo-init package."},{"id":"p69s1","text":"You can use the following command to init a picgo plugin template:"},{"id":"p70s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
